## Upgrading a 1.x template

1. Preserve project content in `agent_docs/`, application code, and real scripts.
2. Review and merge the new root `AGENTS.md`; do not overwrite project-specific commands or boundaries.
3. Move the authoritative skill set to `.agents/skills/` and remove duplicates only after comparing local changes.
4. Replace `.codex/hooks.json` and hook scripts, then review and trust them with `/hooks`.
5. Add `.codex/config.toml` selectively; do not overwrite user or managed model and permission policy.
6. Run the real project lint and tests after migration.
